  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A stencil airbrush painting of grey blocky buildings along a road under a turquoise sky full of grey clouds.",
    "description": "A square stencil airbrush painting on paper with a soft sprayed edge. A turquoise blue sky filled with soft grey cloud shapes sits above blocky buildings in grey gradients with white gaps between their faces, lining a wide grey road that recedes to the lower left. The buildings carry faint diagonal crosshatch texture from the spray. Only the sky is coloured.",
    "impression": "The daytime colourway of the Eastern Parkway scene: a bright turquoise sky over a grey street. The clouds are busier and more mottled than in the sunset version, so it feels windy. Fresh and ordinary in a good way.",
